// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// User-facing copy, centralised for i18n / RTL preparation.
//
// Views must reference `Strings.<name>` instead of inline English literals.
// Symbols (arrows, check marks, "%") stay in the views: they are not copy.
// A future translation layer only needs to replace this global (or bind these
// properties from Rust), with no changes to layout code.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
